This file is generated by tools/generate_npdm.py.
The actual binary main.npdm is a signed JSON-based descriptor that grants the
game process additional filesystem permissions required by Switch-SMAPI:

  FsPermissionBits::MountSdCardWrite
  FsPermissionBits::MountContentWrite

Run:
  python3 tools/generate_npdm.py --title-id 0100E65002BB8000 --output atmosphere/contents/0100E65002BB8000/exefs/main.npdm

The generator reads the original NPDM from your legal game dump, adds the
required bits, and writes a new binary NPDM. The resulting file replaces this
placeholder.
